# Daily 08:00 IST PDF e-mail per Zabbix dashboard, including a chart for EVERY port and EVERY item (previous day).
# Sender: /opt/isp/zabbix/send_daily_reports.py (PDF built by daily_pdf.php = /reports "Dashboard PDF", all ports + all items).
# New dashboards are picked up automatically. Log: /var/log/zabbix/daily-reports.log
# (Paused 2026-10-12 morning, re-enabled 2026-10-12 afternoon, STOPPED 2026-10-13 at user request: alerts only.)
#0 8 * * * root cd /opt/isp/zabbix && /usr/bin/python3 cron_run.py send_daily_reports -- /usr/bin/python3 send_daily_reports.py >> /var/log/zabbix/daily-reports.log 2>&1
# Keeps the native Zabbix "Daily: <dashboard>" scheduled reports in sync but DISABLED (they print only what fits on screen).
15 * * * * root cd /opt/isp/zabbix && /usr/bin/python3 cron_run.py sync_daily_reports -- /usr/bin/python3 sync_daily_reports.py >> /var/log/zabbix/daily-reports-sync.log 2>&1
